Boy, I sure hope our valentines work better than our gym session.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:06.890
He walked out on us.

00:23:07.590 --> 00:23:09.790
Hey, I know what'll cheer him up.

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:11.920
But, Fozzie, wait.

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:13.060
No, no.

00:23:13.060 --> 00:23:15.380
