00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:17.840
Not now, Fozzie. I'm busy.

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:19.460
Okay, here goes.

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:22.530
What kind of food do you eat with your mouth open?

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:27.940
Seafood. Get it? Seafood? Pretty funny, huh?

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:43.510
Uh, Ralph went into the closet to think about my joke. He'll probably come out when he thinks it's funny.

00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:46.510
Gosh, we'll never see him again.

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:47.710
Yeah!

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:55.530
Huh? Come on, you guys! This is an emergency! Go get your valentines! We've got to give them to Ralph right away!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:59.510
I just know Ralph's going to love my valentines!

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:14.460
It's definitely you, Gonzo.

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:16.460
Come on, Gonzo!

00:24:16.460 --> 00:24:20.120
We're an animal!

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:22.940
Let's go, guys!

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:26.080
Let's go for your drink.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.890
Where's Rolf?

00:24:30.890 --> 00:24:32.820
He's in the closet, Nanny.

00:24:32.820 --> 00:24:33.750
Yeah.

00:24:33.750 --> 00:24:37.750
He's real sad 'cause you didn't give him a valentine cookie, Nanny.

00:24:37.750 --> 00:24:38.750
Oh, my.

00:24:38.750 --> 00:24:39.750
Look!

00:24:39.750 --> 00:24:41.750
Here he comes.

00:24:41.750 --> 00:24:45.630
Hey, guys.

00:24:45.630 --> 00:24:46.580
Hi, Nanny.

00:24:46.580 --> 00:24:48.510
What's going on?

00:24:48.510 --> 00:24:49.560
Surprise!

00:24:49.560 --> 00:24:52.580
Happy Valentine's Day, Rolf.

00:24:52.580 --> 00:24:56.480
We made these special valentines just for you.

00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:57.480
Wow, that's cool.

00:24:57.480 --> 00:25:00.000
I just finished my valentine for you.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:30.000
guys. You did? Uh-huh. Listen, this is for all of you. Don't applaud when I walk by. I'm not too good at telling jokes. In fact, I'm kind of shy. But at my piano, I'm a king. I can say most anything, and especially today.

00:25:30.030 --> 00:25:59.640
i wanna try here goes you're special to me and i look special to me not athletic i keep falling down

00:26:01.720 --> 00:26:10.320
blue or green an ordinary brown but when I play music here's the deal I can

00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:16.320
sing the words I feel to tell you I'm so glad that you're around

00:26:16.320 --> 00:26:30.000
you're special to me you're each and every one you're special to me

00:26:36.940 --> 00:26:38.200
special to me.

00:26:40.110 --> 00:26:48.270
That's wonderful.

00:26:49.260 --> 00:26:50.300
Gosh, Rolf,

00:26:50.450 --> 00:26:52.010
that was beautiful.

00:26:52.720 --> 00:26:54.320
When you went in the closet,

00:26:54.620 --> 00:26:56.100
we thought you were mad at us.

00:26:56.380 --> 00:26:58.040
Mad? Nah.

00:26:58.500 --> 00:27:00.000
I just wanted my song

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:00.940
to be a surprise.

00:27:01.400 --> 00:27:03.900
And what a lovely surprise it was, Rolf.

00:27:04.220 --> 00:27:06.800
Now, I have a surprise for you.

00:27:07.180 --> 00:27:07.760
You do?

00:27:08.160 --> 00:27:08.520
Uh-huh.

00:27:08.860 --> 00:27:11.340
I found your cookie on the cookie sheet in the kitchen.

00:27:11.660 --> 00:27:13.920
I guess I forgot it when I brought in the others.

00:27:14.470 --> 00:27:15.420
I'm sorry.

00:27:15.820 --> 00:27:17.300
Wow, thanks, Nanny.

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:19.710
I thought you forgot about me.

00:27:19.930 --> 00:27:22.450
Why, I can never forget any of you, Rolf.

00:27:22.780 --> 00:27:25.960
You kids are the best Valentine I could ever receive.

00:27:26.530 --> 00:27:28.550
We're your Valentine, Nanny?

00:27:28.750 --> 00:27:30.000
That's right, Kermit.

00:27:30.670 --> 00:27:34.450
You kids are my valentines, because we care about each other.

00:27:34.750 --> 00:27:37.330
Hey, this valentine stuff is pretty neat.

00:27:37.620 --> 00:27:40.970
Yeah, there's a whole bunch of people we care about.

00:27:41.230 --> 00:27:43.410
Come on, let's make some more valentines.

00:27:43.850 --> 00:27:44.310
Yeah.

00:27:44.850 --> 00:27:45.590
Can I help?

00:27:45.910 --> 00:27:46.290
Sure.

00:27:46.290 --> 00:27:49.350
Come on, you guys.

00:27:49.630 --> 00:27:52.850
Hey, I wonder if anybody sent me a valentine.

00:27:55.010 --> 00:27:55.570
Oh!

